-- here). GENERATED by export.js from studio_mine_layer.template.luau: edit the template, not this file.
-- Sorts every imported "<Prefix>__<Part>" mesh into one model per car, ReplicatedStorage.CarSkins.<id>, paints each
-- part (the car keeps its own colours) and checks it has Body, WheelFL/FR/RL/RR and Headlights (CarSkin finds the
-- nose by them). Safe to run again. Then save the place (Ctrl+S).
--
-- Each model carries Kart + Extras attributes like CarSkins.ice_viper: CarSkin sizes it by its tyres and carries every
-- other part on the body. Rim pieces named Rim<anything><FL|FR|RL|RR> turn with that wheel. Nose at +Z, left at +X.
-- The swing arm is the parts named Arm* plus Loaded*: they turn about the centre of ArmHinge (a pin across X).
